        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# 🎙️ Image To Audio Story\n\nUpload a photo and a vision agent invents a short story about it, then text-to-speech narrates that story aloud.\n\n**How it works:** \"Load image\" sends the photo to \"Write a story\", an Agent told to write a 150 to 250 word story with a title line, inspired by the image rather than describing it. \"Narrate aloud\" reads the story aloud at speed 1, and the Output node plays the narration. Pick a vision-capable language model on \"Write a story\" and a speech model on \"Narrate aloud\". The speech step is a paid call.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt on \"Write a story\" to \"Write a short poem inspired by this image, eight lines, no title.\" The narration becomes a brief poem instead of a story."
        },
